<urn:atm:triage:finding/AX5-QA1-009>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AX5-QA1-009" ;
  triage:title "Reminder-emit failures other than HerdrUnavailable are silently swallowed with no log or stat" ;
  triage:description "AX.5 QA-1 (quality-mgr ax5-qa-r1, PR #1201 Final Quality Report 2026-09-05T12:38Z) at head da823baaa0018933f8daac388733c51eb14e9335. rust-qa-agent QA-001: in emit_task_reminder the match arm Err(_) => {} (crates/atm-http-runtime/src/herdr_queue_wake.rs:494) drops every emit failure class other than HerdrUnavailable without a log line or stats increment, whereas the parallel queue-drain path (emit_claim) logs member/error/error_code for the same failure class. Fix: log at warn with member/error/error_code and count the failure in the stats, mirroring emit_claim; add a test." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ax" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
